<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef lower on moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings. Select and Choice chuck and round cuts lower, while rib and loin cuts steady to weak. Beef trimmings generally steady on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>301 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 19 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>14 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     101.33	101.18	 96.09	 95.56</p>
<p>Changes	  -0.75	 -1.11	 -0.76	 -0.73</p>
<p>Rib	  165.19	164.88	157.46	157.66</p>
<p>Chuck	 63.93	 63.23	 64.55	 62.69</p>
<p>Round	 82.02	 82.02	 80.43	 80.43</p>
<p>Loin	 169.83	170.26	150.44	150.45</p>
